#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:5
msgid "My account"
msgstr "Moj račun"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:7
msgid ""
"This page is written for the members of your association. It explains what a "
"member can see and do once logged in to Galette. You can send them a link to "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Ta stran je napisana za člane vašega društva. Pojasnjuje, kaj lahko član "
"vidi in počne, ko se prijavi v Galette. Lahko jim pošljete povezavo do njega."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:11
msgid ""
"Some of what is described here depends on choices made by the association: a "
"feature that is not displayed for you has probably been disabled in "
"the :ref:`preferences <man_preferences>`."
msgstr ""
"Nekaj tega, kar je tukaj opisano, je odvisno od izbire povezave: funkcija, "
"ki vam ni prikazana, je bila verjetno onemogočena v :ref:`preferences "
"<man_preferences>`."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:14
msgid "Logging in"
msgstr "Prijava"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:16
msgid ""
"Your association gives you a username and a password, often by email when "
"your member card is created. On the login page, type either your "
"**username** or your **email address**, then your password, and click on "
"**Login**."
msgstr ""
"Vaše združenje vam da uporabniško ime in geslo, pogosto po e-pošti, ko "
"ustvarite svojo člansko izkaznico. Na strani za prijavo vnesite "
"**uporabniško ime** ali **e-poštni naslov**, nato geslo in kliknite "
"**Prijava**."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:18
msgid "Galette login page"
msgstr "Galette prijavna stran"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:23
msgid ""
"If your association allows it, a **Register** button at the top of the page "
"lets people who are not members yet fill in a membership request themselves."
msgstr ""
"Če vaše združenje to dovoljuje, gumb **Registracija** na vrhu strani omogoča "
"ljudem, ki še niso člani, da sami izpolnijo zahtevo za članstvo."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:25
msgid ""
"The language of the interface can be changed at any time from the list at "
"the top right of the page."
msgstr ""
"Jezik vmesnika lahko kadar koli spremenite s seznama v zgornjem desnem kotu "
"strani."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:30
msgid "Forgotten or new password"
msgstr "Pozabljeno ali novo geslo"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:32
msgid ""
"If you do not remember your password - or if it's not been set yet, click on "
"**Lost your password?** under the login form. This link is only displayed "
"when your association has configured the sending of emails."
msgstr ""
"Če se ne spomnite svojega gesla - ali če še ni nastavljeno, kliknite **Ste "
"izgubili geslo?** pod obrazcem za prijavo. Ta povezava je prikazana le, če "
"je vaše združenje konfiguriralo pošiljanje e-pošte."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:34
msgid "Password recovery page"
msgstr "Obnovitev gesla"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:39
msgid ""
"Type your username or your email address, and click on **Recover password**. "
"If an account matches, Galette will send an email to you."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite svoje uporabniško ime ali e-poštni naslov in kliknite **Obnovi "
"geslo**. Če se račun ujema, vam bo Galette poslal e-poštno sporočilo."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:41
msgid ""
"The email you receive contains a link. Follow it, then type your new "
"password twice and click on **Change my password**. The link only works "
"once, and for 24 hours."
msgstr ""
"E-poštno sporočilo, ki ga prejmete, vsebuje povezavo. Sledite ji, nato "
"dvakrat vnesite novo geslo in kliknite **Spremeni moje geslo**. Povezava "
"deluje samo enkrat in to 24 ur."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:45
msgid ""
"No email received? Check your spam folder first. If your member card holds "
"no email address, or an invalid one, no message can be sent: ask a staff "
"member to fix your account information."
msgstr ""
"Niste prejeli e-pošte? Najprej preverite mapo z vsiljeno pošto. Če vaša "
"članska kartica nima e-poštnega naslova ali je neveljaven, sporočila ni "
"mogoče poslati: prosite člana osebja, da popravi podatke o vašem računu."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:48
msgid "Your dashboard"
msgstr "Vaša nadzorna plošča"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:50
msgid ""
"After logging in, you reach your dashboard. It gives a quick access to your "
"information, your contributions and your transactions."
msgstr ""
"Po prijavi pridete na nadzorno ploščo. Omogoča hiter dostop do vaših "
"podatkov, vaših prispevkov in vaših transakcij."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:52
msgid "Dashboard of a member"
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča člana"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:57
msgid "The same pages are listed in the **My Account** menu, on the left:"
msgstr "Iste strani so navedene v meniju **Moj račun** na levi:"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:59
msgid "**My contributions**,"
msgstr "**Moji prispevki**,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:60
msgid "**My scheduled payments**,"
msgstr "**Moja načrtovana plačila**,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:61
msgid "**My transactions**,"
msgstr "**Moje transakcije**,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:62
msgid "**My information**."
msgstr "**Moji podatki**."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Two-factor authentication** and **Add a child member** may also be listed "
"there, when your association has enabled them."
msgstr ""
"**Dvostopenjska avtentikacija** in **Dodaj podrejenega člana** sta lahko "
"tudi navedena tam, če ju je omogočila vaša povezava."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:69
msgid "My information"
msgstr "Moji podatki"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:71
msgid ""
"**My information** displays your member card: your identity, your contact "
"information, the groups you belong to, the state of your membership, ..."
msgstr ""
"**Moji podatki** prikazuje vašo člansko izkaznico: vašo identiteto, vaše "
"kontaktne podatke, skupine, ki jim pripadate, stanje vašega članstva, ..."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:73
msgid "Member card, as seen by the member"
msgstr "Članska izkaznica, kot jo vidi član"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:78
msgid "The state of your membership is displayed under your picture:"
msgstr "Stanje vašega članstva je prikazano pod vašo sliko:"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:80
msgid "**X days remaining (ending on ...)**: your membership is up to date,"
msgstr "**Še X dni (do konca ...)**: vaše članstvo je posodobljeno,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:81
msgid "**Last day!**: your membership ends today,"
msgstr "**Zadnji dan!**: vaše članstvo se konča danes,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:82
msgid ""
"**Late of X days (since ...)**: your membership has expired, it is time to "
"renew it,"
msgstr ""
"**Pozno X dni (od ...)**: vaše članstvo je poteklo, čas je, da ga obnovite,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:83
msgid "**Never contributed**: no membership fee has been recorded for you yet,"
msgstr "**Nikoli prispeval**: za vas še ni bila zabeležena nobena članarina,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:84
msgid "**Freed of dues**: you do not have to pay membership fees."
msgstr "**Oproščen članarine**: ni vam treba plačati članarine."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:87
msgid "Changing your information"
msgstr "Spreminjanje vaših podatkov"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:89
msgid ""
"Click on **Modification** to change your information, then on **Save** at "
"the bottom of the form. Your association decides which fields you can "
"change: the others are read only, or not displayed at all."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na **Sprememba**, da spremenite svoje podatke, nato na **Shrani** "
"na dnu obrazca. Vaša povezava se odloči, katera polja lahko spremenite: "
"druga so samo za branje ali pa sploh niso prikazana."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:91
msgid ""
"To change your password, type the new one in **Password:** and again in "
"**Password confirmation:**. Leave both fields empty to keep your current "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Če želite spremeniti geslo, vnesite novo v **Geslo:** in znova v **Potrditev "
"gesla:**. Pustite obe polji prazni, da obdržite svoje trenutno geslo."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:94
msgid "Other actions"
msgstr "Drugi ukrepi"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:96
msgid "The small arrow next to the **Modification** button opens more actions:"
msgstr "Majhna puščica poleg gumba **Modification** odpre več dejanj:"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:98
msgid "Actions available on the member card"
msgstr "Na voljo so akcije na članski izkaznici"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Generate Member Card**: download your member card as a PDF file. It is "
"only available when your membership is up to date, and when your association "
"allows members to print their card,"
msgstr ""
"**Ustvari člansko izkaznico**: prenesite svojo člansko izkaznico kot "
"datoteko PDF. Na voljo je le, če je vaše članstvo posodobljeno in ko vaše "
"združenje članom dovoli tiskanje svoje kartice,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:104
msgid ""
"**Adhesion form**: download your adhesion form as a PDF file, filled in with "
"your information,"
msgstr ""
"**Pristopni obrazec**: prenesite svoj pristopni obrazec kot datoteko PDF, "
"izpolnjeno z vašimi podatki,"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:105
msgid "**View contributions**: the list of your contributions."
msgstr "**Ogled prispevkov**: seznam vaših prispevkov."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:107
msgid ""
"The small card icon next to your name downloads your contact information as "
"a vCard file, that most address books can import."
msgstr ""
"Ikona majhne kartice poleg vašega imena prenese vaše kontaktne podatke kot "
"datoteko vCard, ki jo lahko uvozi večina imenikov."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:110
msgid "My contributions"
msgstr "Moji prispevki"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:112
msgid ""
"**My contributions** lists the membership fees and donations recorded for "
"you. Each line shows the dates, the type, the amount and the payment type of "
"the contribution."
msgstr ""
"**Moji prispevki** so navedene članarine in donacije, zabeležene za vas. V "
"vsaki vrstici so navedeni datumi, vrsta, višina in način plačila prispevka."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:114
msgid "List of the contributions of a member"
msgstr "Seznam prispevkov člana"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:119
msgid ""
"The PDF icon of the **Actions** column downloads an invoice or a receipt for "
"the contribution, depending on its type."
msgstr ""
"Ikona PDF v stolpcu **Dejanja** prenese račun ali potrdilo o prispevku, "
"odvisno od njegove vrste."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:121
msgid ""
"The filters at the top of the list help to find a contribution: by date, by "
"payment type or by contribution type. Click on **Filter** to apply them, and "
"on **Clear filter** to come back to the whole list."
msgstr ""
"Filtri na vrhu seznama pomagajo najti prispevek: po datumu, po vrsti plačila "
"ali po vrsti prispevka. Kliknite **Filter**, da jih uporabite, in **Počisti "
"filter**, da se vrnete na celoten seznam."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:123
msgid "You cannot add or change a contribution yourself."
msgstr "Sami ne morete dodati ali spremeniti prispevka."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:126
msgid "My transactions and scheduled payments"
msgstr "Moje transakcije in načrtovana plačila"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:128
msgid ""
"A transaction is a payment that covers several contributions; for example, a "
"single check that pays both a membership fee and a donation. **My "
"transactions** lists the transactions recorded for you."
msgstr ""
"Transakcija je plačilo, ki zajema več prispevkov; na primer en ček, ki plača "
"tako članarino kot donacijo. **Moje transakcije** prikazujejo transakcije, "
"ki so bile zabeležene za vas."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:130
msgid ""
"**My scheduled payments** lists the payments that are planned for your "
"contributions, when your association lets you pay in several times."
msgstr ""
"**Moja načrtovana plačila** navaja plačila, ki so načrtovana za vaše "
"prispevke, ko vam vaše združenje dovoli večkratno plačilo."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:132
msgid "Both lists are read only, as for contributions."
msgstr "Oba seznama sta samo za branje, kot pri prispevkih."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:135
msgid "Adding a child member"
msgstr "Dodaj podrejenega člana"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:137
msgid ""
"If your association allows it, **Add a child member** in the **My Account** "
"menu lets you create the member card of a child, or of any person you are "
"responsible for. That card is then attached to yours: you can see and change "
"it, and see its contributions. See also :ref:`links between members "
"<linkmembers>`."
msgstr ""
"Če vaše združenje to dovoljuje, vam **Dodaj otroškega člana** v meniju **Moj "
"račun** omogoči ustvarjanje članske izkaznice otroka ali katere koli osebe, "
"za katero ste odgovorni. Ta kartica je nato pritrjena na vašo: lahko jo "
"vidite in spremenite ter vidite njene prispevke. Glej tudi :ref:`povezave "
"med člani <linkmembers>`."

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:140
msgid "Two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Dvostopenjska avtentikacija"

#: ../usermanual/my_account.rst:142
msgid ""
"When your association has enabled it, you can protect your account with a "
"code that changes every thirty seconds, in addition to your password. This "
"is described in :ref:`two-factor authentication <man_2fa>`."
msgstr ""
"Ko je vaša povezava to omogočila, lahko poleg gesla zaščitite svoj račun s "
"kodo, ki se spremeni vsakih trideset sekund. To je opisano v "
":ref:`dvofaktorski avtentikaciji <man_2fa>`."
